      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"../DefaultTypeMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>DefaultTypeMapper</code></a> with a cache size of 1024, using the given <a href=\"../TypeAliasAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>TypeAliasAccessor</code></a>, <a href=\"../../mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> and\nadditional <a href=\"../TypeInformationMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>TypeInformationMapper</code></a>s.",
